    "type": "game",
    "name": "Zhigu Military Exorcist",
    "steam_appid": 2927030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhigu Military Exorcist is a fascinating combination of strategy, action and mysticism. Players will plunge into a dark world where ancient evil forces threaten humanity, and only an elite squad of exorcists can fight back this threat. You will take on the role of the commander of this squad, combining modern military technology with ancient rituals of exorcism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore gloomy locations, fight terrible creatures and discover the secrets of the other world. Every decision will have consequences, from tactical combat strategies to interaction with forces that are beyond human understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a unique experience where you will not only destroy enemies, but also learn the nature of evil. Your mission is to protect humanity at any cost. Will you be able to cope with the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhigu Military Exorcist is FPS arena shooter against waves of undead and demon armies with different abilities, strong and weak sides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes (is going to be updated):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 30 maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 20 weapons </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 10 healing item types </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 5 armor item types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Demo and Five arena chapters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tecnho-demons have quite interesting and different mechanics. It is hoped that players will enjoy them.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhigu Military Exorcist is a fascinating combination of strategy, action and mysticism. Players will plunge into a dark world where ancient evil forces threaten humanity, and only an elite squad of exorcists can fight back this threat. You will take on the role of the commander of this squad, combining modern military technology with ancient rituals of exorcism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore gloomy locations, fight terrible creatures and discover the secrets of the other world. Every decision will have consequences, from tactical combat strategies to interaction with forces that are beyond human understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a unique experience where you will not only destroy enemies, but also learn the nature of evil. Your mission is to protect humanity at any cost. Will you be able to cope with the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhigu Military Exorcist is FPS arena shooter against waves of undead and demon armies with different abilities, strong and weak sides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes (is going to be updated):</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 30 maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 20 weapons </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 10 healing item types </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 5 armor item types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Demo and Five arena chapters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tecnho-demons have quite interesting and different mechanics. It is hoped that players will enjoy them.</p>",
